# Pass "incompat-original": the original mod this one declares itself incompatible with, alone beside it.
#
# Ebbbs by Coolie, Workshop 2817264755, which declares 1.5 and nothing further. About.xml names it in
# incompatibleWith because the two define the same nine defNames. RimWorld does not refuse two mods that do:
# Verse.DefDatabase.Add logs an error for each duplicate and renames the later def. This pass stages both and
# plays 05-original-mod-incompatibility, which asserts that symptom, so a green run says the
# incompatibility is still true.
#
# The packageId below is the one About.xml names, Coolie.Ebbbs. It has NOT been checked against the
# original's own About.xml, which is not installed on this machine, and the staging script only finds out
# when it tries to load it.
#
# The item has to be in the WSL install's Workshop cache before this pass can stage it. That is a download,
# so it goes through Use-Wsl.ps1 like any other work on the machine (PickleTools/Headless/README.md, "The
# lock is about the machine"). It has not been downloaded.
Coolie.Ebbbs   2817264755
